{
  "slug": "fastly-agent-toolkit",
  "name": "Fastly Agent Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Fastly development tools and platform skills",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `falco` (Lints, tests, simulates, and formats Fastly VCL code using the falco tool), `fastlike` (Runs Fastly Compute WASM binaries locally and serves as the authoritative reference for Compute platform internals), `fastly` (Configures, manages, and debugs the Fastly CDN platform — covering service and backend setup, caching and VCL, security…), `fastly-cli` (Executes Fastly CLI commands for managing CDN services, Compute deploys, and edge infrastructure), `fastly-fiddle` (Use when testing VCL against real Fastly edge infrastructure, writing assertion-based Fiddle tests, producing shareable fiddle URLs for…), `fastly-ngwaf` (Performs an internal audit of Fastly Next-Gen WAF (NGWAF) workspaces to audit that critical templated protection rules are…), `fastly-reference-architectures` (Curated GitHub repositories demonstrating working reference architectures on the Fastly platform, from single Compute applications to systems combining…), `fastly-stats` (Fastly traffic numbers: cache hit ratio, bandwidth, request counts, status-code and error rates, edge vs origin traffic, real-time…), and 2 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install fastly-agent-toolkit@claude-plugins-official` from `fastly/fastly-agent-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
